      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-01-15T22:30:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can aim <span class=\"bbcode-i\">any</span> damage at someone who's immune, it's just that nothing will happen. If the attack has any other effects, however (such as Wraith's Stun Bolts, which nerf the target's damage by one point till her next turn), these will still occur :).</p>",
